1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,921
An ML score can improve even when the underlying comparison is not fair.

2
00:00:04,871 --> 00:00:11,915
Research Audit Workbench helps researchers and browser agents inspect the evidence before committing more time or compute.

3
00:00:11,915 --> 00:00:14,824
This is the real authenticated workflow.

4
00:00:14,824 --> 00:00:21,109
I am importing the subtle prepared example: two runs from the same benchmark whose scores appear comparable.

5
00:00:21,109 --> 00:00:25,105
The package remains temporary while the application checks it.

6
00:00:25,105 --> 00:00:34,532
Before anything is saved, the preview reconstructs both runs, displays their metrics, inventories every source file, and computes a canonical digest.

7
00:00:34,532 --> 00:00:39,228
Confirmation makes this exact evidence package durable and owner-scoped.

8
00:00:39,228 --> 00:00:42,932
The imported pair now becomes an active investigation.

9
00:00:42,932 --> 00:00:50,817
The decision question and trusted snapshots are available to both the researcher and the browser agent without copying state into a prompt.

10
00:00:50,817 --> 00:01:00,841
Seven Web M C P tools can inspect the comparison, run the audit, focus evidence, stage a challenge or plan, review readiness, and retrieve a decision brief.

11
00:01:00,841 --> 00:01:03,761
Deterministic code owns the findings.

12
00:01:03,761 --> 00:01:07,593
Here the candidates, split, and preprocessing match.

13
00:01:07,593 --> 00:01:14,357
Both scores even say N D C G at ten, but Run A is micro-averaged while Run B is macro-averaged.

14
00:01:14,357 --> 00:01:18,796
The audit preserves both metrics and refuses an unsupported ranking.

15
00:01:18,796 --> 00:01:25,502
The finding cites the exact configuration locations, evidence level, values, and source hashes.

16
00:01:25,502 --> 00:01:28,703
Agent prose never becomes the source of truth.

17
00:01:28,703 --> 00:01:32,359
Saving the audit reveals a visible human checkpoint.

18
00:01:32,359 --> 00:01:38,095
Because this is a bundled teaching sample, Tab and Enter insert the recommended context.

19
00:01:38,095 --> 00:01:44,310
A custom import requires the researcher's own explanation, and only the researcher can confirm it.

20
00:01:44,310 --> 00:01:51,869
The context can revise the intended use of the result, but it cannot erase the metric-definition limitation or its citations.

21
00:01:51,869 --> 00:01:55,058
That boundary is retained in the next revision.

22
00:01:55,058 --> 00:01:58,995
Run A is prefilled to Run B's evaluation protocol.

23
00:01:58,995 --> 00:02:08,925
Whole-audit validation checks the plan, an operational batch-size change receives a new digest, and the editable rationale binds human approval to that exact version.

24
00:02:08,925 --> 00:02:12,056
The final record is authoritative and durable.

25
00:02:12,056 --> 00:02:18,563
Web M C P can inspect and stage work, but it cannot save, approve, delete, or execute.
